  "chatter": "<p>The retirement of Republican Rep. Don Bacon has given Democrats a strong pickup opportunity for his Omaha-based 2nd District, which voted for Democrats for president in 2020 and 2024 in Nebraska’s split electoral vote<span class=\"widont\">&nbsp;</span>system.</p>\n<p>Independent candidate Dan Osborn is again running for U.S. Senate, this time against Republican Sen. Pete Ricketts. While Ricketts is expected to win, the independent Osborn is likely to outperform a typical Democratic candidate in the<span class=\"widont\">&nbsp;</span>state.</p>\n"
